{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Chromatic Index.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Chromatic Index.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"chromatic index chromatic index","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Chromatic Index.md","fileName":"Chromatic Index.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Chromatic Index","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-06 00:13\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Graph Algorithms]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Graph Algorithms","Edge Coloring","algorithms.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Chromatic Index.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Chromatic Index.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"chromatic index chromatic index","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Chromatic Index.md","fileName":"Chromatic Index.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Chromatic Index","heading":"Chromatic Index","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The chromatic index of a graph is the minimum number of colors needed for a valid [[Edge Coloring]]. It therefore measures the smallest number of mutually exclusive slots required when adjacent edges cannot receive the same assignment.\n\nFor a tournament graph, the chromatic index is the minimum number of days required under the rule that each player can appear in only one match per day. A greedy algorithm can find a valid schedule without always attaining this minimum.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Graph Algorithms","Edge Coloring","algorithms.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Chromatic Index.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Chromatic Index.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"chromatic index chromatic index","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Chromatic Index.md","fileName":"Chromatic Index.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Chromatic Index","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[algorithms.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Graph Algorithms","Edge Coloring","algorithms.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}